Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马){\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.51,0:00:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})现在作为同伴齐心协力 一起战斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 那家伙的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正姿态！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(蝉丸) 先攻就由我拿下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊最讨厌拖拖拉拉的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场标签决斗 从第1回合开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.65,0:00:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用允许攻击的规则来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别擅自决定啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤油蝉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我还要特殊召唤梦蝉 睡眠眠！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有攻击表示的昆虫族怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己场上的1只昆虫族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:01:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 油蝉变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}油蝉在改变表示形式时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只可以当作2只份的超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级3的油蝉 2只份和
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游泳蚊 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只份的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.03,0:01:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.3！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.47,0:01:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.3！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.40,0:01:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这正是为了埋葬你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从贝库塔大人那里赐予的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}… 不管你这家伙自称什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的3号是 本大爷的 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从漫长的沉眠中苏醒高声唱响地狱的凯歌吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地狱蝉王 蝗虫王！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 那家伙的 No.怪兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 守备表示？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明从第1回合开始就说了会有攻击的…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.74,0:01:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 不能大意哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定 在盘算着什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放2张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马 对你来说 没有星光体的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 是巨大的试炼。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了与你一同跨越它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到你重新站起来的样子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才来到了这里！》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《翻倍机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 和Astral
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一次见面时的决斗中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用霍普和这张卡的 combo……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人一起战斗一起向前走过来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就算只剩一个人也必须继续向前走》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.Heartland)怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.07,0:04:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有Astral就束手无策了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了 苍蝇混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}苍蝇就是嗡嗡嗡地吵嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(我我我魔术师)我我我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 我特殊召唤 影蜥蜴！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 在等级4的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤成功时 可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《Astral 你看着吧》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级4的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影蜥蜴 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就出场了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.09,0:05:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体…》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃…不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在得集中精力决斗才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再从手牌发动 永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻·复活·奖励！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将1张速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对方观看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将双重·提升·机会盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双重·提升·机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过速攻·复活·奖励的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖放的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合可以发动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到那个效果的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗时 攻击力变成两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 攻击守备怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果这边的攻击力超过了那个守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就那部分给对手造成伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《原来如此 游马是通过希望的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将战斗无效
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从而{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动翻倍机会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:05:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让希望的攻击力变成两倍后再进行攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上速攻·复活·奖励的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.27,0:06:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会再翻一倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这招一旦成功
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能给那家伙造成7500的大伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.07,0:06:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 真是个好连招啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然你通过与星光体同行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为决斗者成长了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 即使失去了星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也仍然想要向前迈进》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我用希望皇 霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对焦土之王发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让霍普自身的攻击无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 消耗一个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动焦土之王的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方怪兽使用效果时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将该怪兽效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记忆猎手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你使用的效果就被无效化了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:07:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 因为这个效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}焦土之王的守备力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力居然有3000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摆成守备表示，就是冲着这个来的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(蝉丸)真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗没有无效化，因此{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的魔法卡无法发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以攻击力保持不变，战斗继续！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的这点小事算不了什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}白白丢了500点生命值，真是可怜啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.28,0:07:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你一个人再怎么努力，说到底凡人就是凡人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有星光体在，你不过是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}个垃圾决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你不是孤身一人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今失去了星光{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
