Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.49,0:15:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙的记忆明明应该全都被夺走了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.43,0:15:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为是伙伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 又是你们擅长的友情过家家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！ 就算记忆被夺走{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刻在灵魂里对朋友的思念也不会改变！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.42,0:15:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《大家…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我还有…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马 加油…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我还有伙伴们！》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.89,0:16:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是和伙伴们一起战斗的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 我把希望托付给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放·逆转·爆破！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的1只超量怪兽送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上盖放的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法 陷阱卡全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要送去墓地的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我的陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你们在我下一个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.01,0:16:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}依然会败北！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要从手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将闪亮闪耀者特殊召唤到{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己场上没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤到对方场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 因为这个效果 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己的回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会受到500点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我恢复500点生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂喂 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的生命值 只剩200了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是打算对同伴见死不救只顾自己活命吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这就是相信同伴的我的王牌》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一到关键时刻就为了自己活命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}牺牲同伴是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的同伴才不是那种东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在就证明给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马现在盖下的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.11,0:17:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那真的是我所想的那张卡的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法 我我我连锁！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.62,0:17:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以减少1个。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.11,0:17:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:17:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用1只等级6的闪闪发光的萨拉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.6！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先史遗产 大西洲巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大西洲巨人在召唤时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备墓地中的1只 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅提升其攻击力相应的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用释放·逆转·爆破{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不是为了破坏我的盖牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是为了把霍普送去墓地啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})看吧！在战斗中结下的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与朋友的羁绊所唤醒的希望之光！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 由于永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}金字塔·眼·药片的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:19:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.19,0:19:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升800点。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 岩石帝王的攻击力是 4700。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗产生的伤害 不过1200。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 阿特兰塔尔 攻击 岩石帝王！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！超量·破坏!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使1只怪兽的攻击无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让攻击无效？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了抓住真正的胜利啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 双重·提升·机会 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才以失效告终的连招……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 当怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被无效时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使那只怪兽的攻击力变为2倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.91,0:19:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并让它可以再次攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在这里发动永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.75,0:19:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快速·复权·奖励的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使阿特兰塔尔的攻击力再变为2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 23600!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用阿特兰塔尔 对骷髅王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一次 攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马/{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})超越人智的神之遗产
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿希望之光之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炽热羁绊的裁决即将降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.01,0:20:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！这就是同伴的力量!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 交错·阿特兰塔尔·斩!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝉…蝉丸！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…九十九游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟是在…做什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.13,0:21:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.03,0:21:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢大家了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的鼓励我确实收到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.90,0:21:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为同伴的证明希望你能收下。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…No.卡3。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.80,0:21:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能得到这家伙全是多亏了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡的力量，就让我收下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.25,0:21:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的决斗，你看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.13,0:21:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，你不在了之后，好难过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来觉得已经不行了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:22:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我还有伙伴。哪有功夫一直消沉下去啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过啊，星光。我…》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.55,0:23:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.47,0:23:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.84,0:23:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.04,0:23:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.71,0:23:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.23,0:23:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.84,0:24:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.52,0:24:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.63,0:24:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
